+# Design — Testing Your Next Chapter
+
+## Frame
+
+- 1920×1080, with a 120px content inset and a reserved footer zone.
+- Navy is the anchor surface; paper and cultured-white panels create the field-note pages.
+- A persistent route line and small evidence counter unify the lesson without competing with narration.
+
+## Type
+
+- Proxima Nova, using the system fallback when unavailable.
+- Display: 96px, 900 weight. Headings: 64px, 900 weight. Body: 42px, 400 weight.
+- Short phrases only on screen. Narration lives in timed clip metadata, not dense paragraphs.
+
+## Graphic language
+
+- Gold marks action, active experiment nodes, and decisive evidence.
+- Blue marks questions, connections, and discovered information.
+- Cards have 12px corners, thin borders, and restrained shadows.
+- Simple inline SVG icons use strokes and geometric forms; no external media is required.
+
+## Motion
+
+- One paused, seekable GSAP timeline drives all changes.
+- Each beat enters within 1.2 seconds; the prior content exits before the next beat settles.
+- The route line grows from left to right while evidence cards rise into place.
+- No infinite animation. The final second adds a gold confirmation mark.
+
